ithub.com/dlwh","id":9633,"login":"dlwh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh","user_view_type":"public"},"commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-03-06T00:36:57Z","event":"closed","id":12021109670,"intent":null,"node_id":"CE_lADOCTkjjc6BXJrRzwAAAALMg5Om","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/12021109670"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118399608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adityaanikam","id":118399608,"login":"adityaanikam","node_id":"U_kgDOBw6ieA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityaanikam","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2026-08-07T17:13:53Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nThe **return** value of a function with `donate_argnums` can give incorrect results on CUDA GPUs depending on output order. For example, the following function:\n\n```python\ndef f(state, val):\n    y = val - val\n    ys = (y, y, y)\n    return (ys, state)\n\n\nys, new_state = jax.jit(f, donate_argnums=(0,))(\n    (jnp.float32(1), jnp.float32(2), jnp.float32(3)),\n    jnp.float32(0),\n)\n```\n\nThe result is\n\n```\nnew_state (Array(1., dtype=float32), Array(2., dtype=float32), Array(2., dtype=float32))\nys        (Array(0., dtype=float32), Array(2., dtype=float32), Array(0., dtype=float32))\n```\n\nWhile the expected result should be (note the last item of `new_state` and the second item of `ys`):\n\n```\nnew_state (Array(1., dtype=float32), Array(2., dtype=float32), Array(3., dtype=float32))\nys        (Array(0., dtype=float32), Array(0., dtype=float32), Array(0., dtype=float32))\n```\n\nIf we don't specify `donate_argnums` or return `(new_state, ys)` instead of `(ys, new_state)`, the results will be the expected one.\n\nThis problem also does not happen on CPUs, or if the state and result tuple contain less than 3 items.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Full script</summary>\n\n```python\nimport os\n\nimport jax\nfrom jax import numpy as jnp\n\ndonate = os.environ.get(\"DONATE\", \"1\") != \"0\"\nstate_first = os.environ.get(\"STATE_FIRST\", \"0\") != \"0\"\n\n\ndef f(state, val):\n    y = val - val\n    ys = (y, y, y)\n    return (state, ys) if state_first else (ys, state)\n\n\nout = jax.jit(f, donate_argnums=(0,) if donate else ())(\n    (jnp.float32(1), jnp.float32(2), jnp.float32(3)),\n    jnp.float32(0),\n)\n\nnew_state, ys = out if state_first else out[::-1]\nprint(\"new_state\", new_state)\nprint(\"ys\", ys)\n\nassert all(jnp.array_equal(y, jnp.float32(0)) for y in ys)\n```\n</details>\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.11.0                                                                                                          \njaxlib: 0.11.0                                                                                                          \nnumpy:  2.4.4                                                                                                           \npython: 3.12.13 (main, Apr 14 2026, 14:29:00) [Clang 22.1.3 ]                                                           \ndevice info: NVIDIA A100-SXM4-80GB-1, 1 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='', release='5.15.152.bsk.10-amd64', version='#5.15.152.bsk.10 SMP Debian 5.15.152.bsk.10 Tue Aug 19 08:45:09 ', machine='x86_64')\n\nNVIDIA-SMI 535.261.03             Driver Version: 535.261.03   CUDA Version: 12.2\n```","closed_at":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39625/comments","created_at":"2026-07-31T14:10:39Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39625/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/39625","id":5030354562,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39625/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABK9Uegg","number":39625,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39625/reactions"},"repository":{"allow_forking":true,"archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/{archive_format}{/ref}","archived":false,"assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.co